# keys.pdl (rta-board, D116) - the keys of the Robot Trap Auto window while Joe's token is possessed. DATA for vox_keys_op: a KEYMAP row with a 5th field runs that command ($D = the house root); every rule stays in rta_life_op.
# KEYMAP | keycode | name | label | command
# There is NO arrow-walk: Joe's place on the board is derived (beside the car), the ledger has no walk row for him (rta_walk_op is a separate Centon op). Enter-car is valid only beside the car (the op refuses otherwise).
ACTOR | joe
KEYMAP | 105 | enter | i=enter car | $D/@.apps/rta/ops/+x/rta_life_op.+x enter $D/@.apps/rta/rules.pdl $D/#.desktop/rta_life_ledger.txt joe car
KEYMAP | 1001 | drive | right=drive one road step | $D/@.apps/rta/ops/+x/rta_life_op.+x drive $D/@.apps/rta/rules.pdl $D/#.desktop/rta_life_ledger.txt joe car $D/@.apps/rta/ops/+x/rta_momentum_op.+x $D/@.apps/rta/road.grid $D/#.desktop/rta_mom_ledger.txt $D/#.desktop/rta_mom_events.txt
KEYMAP | 111 | exit | o=exit car | $D/@.apps/rta/ops/+x/rta_life_op.+x exit $D/@.apps/rta/rules.pdl $D/#.desktop/rta_life_ledger.txt joe car
KEYMAP | 107 | eat | k=eat | $D/@.apps/rta/ops/+x/rta_life_op.+x eat $D/@.apps/rta/rules.pdl $D/#.desktop/rta_life_ledger.txt joe
KEYMAP | 110 | sleep | n=sleep 8 turns | $D/@.apps/rta/ops/+x/rta_life_op.+x sleep $D/@.apps/rta/rules.pdl $D/#.desktop/rta_life_ledger.txt joe 8
LEGEND | possess Joe (Enter on him) then: i enter car (stand beside it), right arrow drives, o exit, k eat, n sleep
